%abc-2.1
% Melody, chords and words transcribed by hand from the writers' own lead sheet,
% sources/sheetPdf.pdf (larryholdermusic.org/scores/watchagonnado.pdf), bar for bar.
% Bar numbers match the PDF. The PDF is a single melody line with chord symbols;
% there is no piano left hand or inner voice to transcribe. No tune.mid exists for
% this song, so nothing was cross-checked against MIDI. Key signature, the blue
% notes (Ab, Db) and the double-flat G spelling in the F bars are as the PDF writes
% them. Words follow the PDF where it differs from lyrics.chordpro ("calling out
% your name", "His peace, His love"). The PDF writes only one set of words for the
% repeated last chorus.
X:1
T:Watcha Gonna Do?
C:Music by Peter Gringhuis
C:Lyrics by Larry Holder
Z:Transcribed from the writers' lead sheet (2009)
M:4/4
L:1/16
Q:1/4=100
K:Bb
